# Wix Headless connection (optional)
#
# Without this set, the site runs entirely on curated sample events so it's
# fully browsable out of the box. To connect it to a real Wix Events
# collection:
#
# 1. Create a Wix Headless project at https://manage.wix.com and enable the
#    Wix Events app on the connected site.
# 2. Create an OAuth client ID for your headless project (Settings > Headless
#    Settings > OAuth apps) and paste it below.
WIX_CLIENT_ID=
